{"id":"ruta-40-argentina","title":"Ruta 40, Argentina","who":"Classic route · Argentina's spine by motorcycle","when":"November to March (southern summer)","vehicle":"Adventure motorcycle, 3–5 weeks","kind":"moto","color":"#0284c7","summary":"About 5,000 km along the Andes, from the glaciers of Santa Cruz to the high desert of the north-west: Perito Moreno, Fitz Roy, Patagonian wind on endless steppe, the lakes of Bariloche, the wine of Mendoza and Cafayate, and the coloured gorges near Salta. Mostly paved now, with wild gravel stretches left, and roadworks in 2026 (repaving between Bariloche and El Bolsón; the widening south of San Juan is stalled).","sources":[{"label":"Noticias NQN: Vialidad reinforces Ruta 40 before winter (March 2026)","url":"https://www.noticiasnqn.com.ar/noticias/2026/03/18/329643-vialidad-nacional-reforzara-la-ruta-40-con-2300-toneladas-de-asfalto-antes-del-invierno"},{"label":"La Gaceta: a Tucumán couple rides to Ushuaia (February 2025)","url":"https://www.lagaceta.com.ar/nota/1070396/sociedad/pareja-tucumana-fue-ushuaia-moto-da-detalles-viaje-paisajes-ensueno"},{"label":"Argentina.travel: Ruta 40, an unforgettable journey","url":"https://www.argentina.travel/novedades/la-ruta-40-un-viaje-inolvidable-por-el-corazon-de-argentina"}],"approximate":"Main towns from south to north.","km":4386,"bbox":[-72.8859,-50.3443,-64.5599,-25.1177],"stops":[{"name":"El Calafate","place":"El Calafate, Argentina","at":[-50.3387,-72.2737],"text":"The Perito Moreno glacier calving into Lago Argentino.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Perito_Moreno_Glacier_2023.jpg/500px-Perito_Moreno_Glacier_2023.jpg","page":"Perito Moreno Glacier","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Perito_Moreno_Glacier_2023.jpg","credit":"Fernando","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"El Chaltén","place":"El Chaltén, Argentina","at":[-49.332,-72.886],"text":"The trekking village under Fitz Roy.","source":{"label":"La Gaceta (2025)","url"